  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the tagine pot to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Cut the almonds in half and toast them in the tagine pot until lightly browned.",
    "Cut the tempeh into 1-inch cubes and add to the tagine pot.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the water, olive oil, ketchup, tempering chocolate, salt, black pepper, and garlic powder.",
    "Pour the wet ingredients over the tempeh and almonds, and stir to coat.",
    "Cook for 20 minutes, or until the tempeh is tender and the almonds are crispy.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional almonds if desired."
  ],
